  "reasons": {
    "app/_shared/shared-shell.css": "30 -> 31 on 2026-09-02 (hub #605). The pin block's `--nds-chrome-bg: #18263b` is a literal BY NECESSITY: it is the root of the chrome chain. `shared-shell.css:606` derives `--nds-rail-bg: var(--nds-chrome-bg)` on a selector list that includes `body:has(.h10-shell)` itself, so pinning chrome-bg to rail-bg would close a var() cycle and drop all three grounds; `--nds-rail-surface` is #f1f3f5, a light grey, so it is not a candidate either. Every other pin in that block derives from this one. The other three tokens added at the same time DID convert (--nds-purple-700 / --nds-cyan-700 / --nds-blue-700), which is why this is +1 and not +4."
  }
